# `C99`'s manifest leg (`M154g-10`). `tflw spec --json` documents `timeout api`/`timeout browser` as
# the way to set the two independently; `parser.ts`'s `TIMEOUT_TARGETS` is `step`/`expect`/`wait` and
# this file is a `TF010`. Committed so the assertion has a real fixture rather than a string.

defaults
  timeout api 5s

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507"
